Port Cabal-syntax-json to the Cabal-syntax 3.19 API (stable-haskell fork,
branch hkm/sh-merge2-ports = upstream master + haskell/cabal#12356).

* CondTree/CondBranch lost the constraint type parameter (CondTree v c a ->
  CondTree v a; CondNode lost its middle field).
* Verbosity split: silent/normal are VerbosityFlags; wrap them with
  mkVerbosity defaultVerbosityHandles for readGenericPackageDescription.
* Distribution.Compat.Newtype is gone (upstream "Scrap
  Distribution.Compat.Newtype"): the FieldGrammar *Ala methods take
  `Coercible a b` and a `proxy a b`, so convert with `coerce`; the ViaUnpack
  deriving (which relied on Newtype's fundep) becomes plain instances for
  TestedWith, List and MQuoted, and Vertically loses its Newtype instance.
* freeTextField/freeTextFieldDef/prefixedFields use Text;
  freeTextFieldDefST was removed.
* Token and Token' wrap Text rather than String: derive their JSON via a
  new ToJSON Text instance.

The golden test suite (293 tests) passes against this Cabal.

